## 1. Interface & Default Runtime Invariants

- **Public API preserved:** [`Backend`](file:///private/tmp/spawned-scenario-tests/concurrency/src/tasks/actor.rs#L32-L38), [`Actor`](file:///private/tmp/spawned-scenario-tests/concurrency/src/tasks/actor.rs#L50-L58), [`Handler<M>`](file:///private/tmp/spawned-scenario-tests/concurrency/src/tasks/actor.rs#L68-L70), [`Context<A>`](file:///private/tmp/spawned-scenario-tests/concurrency/src/tasks/actor.rs#L116-L122), [`ActorRef<A>`](file:///private/tmp/spawned-scenario-tests/concurrency/src/tasks/actor.rs#L391-L397), and [`ActorStart`](file:///private/tmp/spawned-scenario-tests/concurrency/src/tasks/actor.rs#L761-L771) signatures are unchanged.
- **Default runtime path:** Without `--features backend-experiments`, [`ActorRef::spawn`](file:///private/tmp/spawned-scenario-tests/concurrency/src/tasks/actor.rs#L550-L627) and [`run_actor`](file:///private/tmp/spawned-scenario-tests/concurrency/src/tasks/actor.rs#L673-L754) compile to the original behavior. With `backend-experiments` enabled and env vars unset, `Backend::Async` still dispatches via `rt::spawn(inner_future)` with `turn = None`, though [`ActorRef::spawn`](file:///private/tmp/spawned-scenario-tests/concurrency/src/tasks/actor.rs#L573) still queries `std::env::var("SPAWNED_EXPERIMENT_SCHEDULER")` on every spawn.

